Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.94,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}A route warning about paying an embarkation fee appears
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.38,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}路线提示“会支付登船费”，是下
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.38,0:00:06.43,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}令前的警告；实际扣款要另看。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.94,0:00:07.84,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}before ordering; actual payment needs separate evidence.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.43,0:00:11.52,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}这次军队进入海区后，独立现金查询和原生支付链对
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.84,0:00:12.68,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}After this army entered a sea zone, an independent cash query and the
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.52,0:00:16.61,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}上了一笔三金币扣款，属于这个账户的这一次登船。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.68,0:00:17.03,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}native payment chain matched a 3-gold debit for this account's
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.61,0:00:20.07,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}它不自动成为所有军队的固定费率。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.03,0:00:17.87,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}embarkation.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.87,0:00:20.84,English,en-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}That is not a universal fee for every army.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.07,0:00:24.63,Chinese,zh-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}县域损失预算也一样：提示的是特定条件下的计
